    "description": {
      "value": "With a flick of your wrist, you fling a chunk of your elemental matter at your foe. Make a ranged spell attack roll, dealing 1d8 damage on a success and double damage on a critical success.\n\nThis spell deals damage according to your elemental influence (for instance, slashing for air or fire for fire) and has your element's trait."
